From: dwong <dowling.wong@kit.edu>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 17:49:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] evidence: complete the transfer_paper migration to a
 canonical, versioned evidence root

MS bf7d5f6 removed the duplicated transfer bundle but left every consumer
pointing at it: the LaTeX figure includes, the claim validator (49 errors), the
two figure generators, the revision checker, the packaging list and the bundle
verifier (which lived inside the deleted directory).  A fresh build failed on
transfer_paper/figures/likelihood_geometry_hierarchy.pdf.

- evidence/ is the manuscript evidence root: 251 files, 20.6 MB, recovered from
  MS c826ef6 and checked against the recorded BUNDLE_MANIFEST.json (327/327
  listed entries match on sha256 and byte count).  evidence/MANIFEST.json is
  complete, including the 24 Part II files the old manifest never listed.
- scripts/evidence_root.py: one resolution rule (--evidence-root,
  $PAPER1_EVIDENCE_ROOT, else <repo>/evidence).  No absolute path in source.
- scripts/materialize_evidence.py rebuilds or --checks the export from
  <EXP>/transfer_paper or from this repository's history; every excluded path
  (data/gwosc/runs/, 66 files) is hashed into the manifest, so an omission is a
  checkable decision.
- scripts/verify_evidence.py replaces transfer_paper/scripts/verify_bundle.py
  with the same checks (--require-complete, --compare, --fail-on-scientific-diff).
- scripts/export_tidmad_heldout.py replaces the three report-transcribed Fig. 10
  CSVs with full-precision rows from the T10-T12 archive, which was located on
  the execution host at results/mlst_2026-09-10 and verifies against its
  RESULTS_SHA256.  The recomputed post-hoc sensitivity now reproduces the
  archived theta_IV and Q exactly; the DL interval moves +2.0e-03 -> +1.9e-03,
  and no verdict or primary estimand changes.
- Claim rows 22-24 cite the registered MS copies: the originating EXP tree
  results/mlst_2026-09-11 (ea076ff) is absent from the synchronized experiment
  repository.  Recorded as gap G1 in evidence/PROVENANCE.md, separately from
  file integrity.
- .gitattributes keeps evidence/ byte-exact (no EOL normalization).
- Historical bundle documents preserved under archive/transfer_paper_docs/.

Checks: verify_evidence --require-complete OK; validate_claim_table 0 errors,
9/9 values re-read; check_revision_claims ALL PASSED; protocol_dry_run and
--part2 PASS; fresh latexmk build in a clean outdir, 113 pages, no undefined
references.

