+CRESST-A linear hierarchy (public real data),verified_positive,Results and Methods,"Rank-6 EMPCA beat single-template OF and met the multi-template-OF competitiveness gate across seven channels; pulse and noise streams were each split chronologically, separately. All five pooled negative controls degraded.",Do not claim cross-channel transfer or validated detection sensitivity; disclose the one wrong-PSD channel exception.
+CRESST-A channel-aware sensitivity analysis,verified_positive_post_freeze_sensitivity,"Results, Discussion, and Limitations","Equal-channel effects and channel-then-event hierarchical 95% intervals remained positive for OF minus EMPCA, the multi-template competitiveness margin, and PCA minus EMPCA.","Do not replace the frozen pooled primary analysis, treat 19,335 events as independent detector-level replications, or generalize from seven clusters and two runs."
+Study A noise-budget decomposition,verified,Results/Appendix,"SQUID/Johnson/TD/Er component PSD fractions and crossovers, computed directly from the authoritative component files under their native labels.",Do not relabel components with any other physical name not recorded in provenance.
