+GWpy PSD reference,"data/gwosc/current/gwosc/gwpy_reference.json, data/derived/gwosc_reference_summary.csv","Repository/GWpy PSD ratios have median, p05, and p95 equal to 1.0 at recorded precision; relative L2 error is 0.0. Exact PSD match recorded: True.",The PSD-estimation method can be described as independently verified against GWpy for identical calibration windows.,PSD estimator agreement does not prove that the resulting matched statistic is calibrated on held-out real noise.
+Global PSD held-out real-noise calibration,"data/gwosc/current/gwosc/experiment.json, data/derived/gwosc_null_calibration.csv, figures/gwosc_null_calibration.*",H1 random median/min/max 1.986/1.396/7.166; L1 random 1.263/1.209/3.093. H1 chronological median 3.183; L1 chronological median 2.964.,The Results should report this as a negative real-data result: global PSD calibration failed despite PSD reference agreement.,Do not convert event or injection scores into significance or sensitivity claims under this failed calibration.
