+Time-local PSD follow-up,"data/configs/gwosc/time_local_noise.yaml, data/source_documents/GWOSC_RESULT.md, data/gwosc/followup/time_local_noise.json, data/derived/gwosc_time_local_psd_summary.csv","Synthetic primary local-64 control passed (std 1.148); real H1/L1 failed the [0.8, 1.2] primary gate with full coverage (H1 global/local-64 std 1.771/9.424; L1 global/local-64 std 7.288/8.827).",The Results should report this as a verified negative real-data follow-up: the tested local PSD model did not calibrate this GWOSC interval.,"The failure does not invalidate the synthetic theory; it shows that this real interval is not calibrated by the tested global or fixed-radius local PSD models. Do not retune radius, cuts, thresholds, or windows after inspection."
